  "Octavia Amphora provider uses dedicated instances to run load balancers. Each load balancer is deployed as one or more instance, providing strong isolation and full feature support. This provider requires additional compute resources and management of amphora images. Octavia OVN provider implements load balancing directly in the OVN networking layer without using instances. It supports only Layer 4 protocols (TCP/UDP) and does not provide advanced L7 features. This provider offers lower resource overhead but a more limited feature set compared to the Amphora provider.": "Octavia Amphora提供商使用专用实例运行负载均衡器。每个负载均衡器部署为一个或多个实例，提供强大的隔离和全面的功能支持。此提供商需要额外的计算资源和镜像管理。Octavia OVN提供商直接在OVN网络层实现负载均衡，不使用实例。它仅支持第4层协议（TCP/UDP），不提供高级第7层功能。此提供商提供较低的资源开销，但功能集比Amphora提供商更有限。",
  "Octavia load balancers distribute traffic across back-end members through listeners and pools.": "Octavia 负载均衡通过监听器和资源池将流量分发到后端成员。",
